  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_037) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.706). Testing config_004 (rna_only with scvi_n200 and multiprofile) will clarify whether the RNA encoder itself is a critical factor, independent of multimodal fusion. This addresses uncertainty about the scvi_n200 encoder's impact and whether multiprofile settings benefit RNA-only models, which could guide future resource allocation."
